    {"id": "m7_060", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "平方根等于它本身的数是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. 0", "B. 1", "C. -1", "D. ±1"], "kps": ["kp_square_root"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "0的平方根是0；1的平方根是±1，不等于它本身。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_061", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "-27的立方根是____。", "answer": "-3", "kps": ["kp_cube_root"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "(-3)³=-27，负数的立方根是负数。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_062", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "立方根是4的数是____。", "answer": "64", "kps": ["kp_cube_root"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "4³=64。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_063", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列说法正确的是（　）", "answer": "C", "options": ["A. 负数没有立方根", "B. 一个数的立方根有两个", "C. -8的立方根是-2", "D. 8的立方根是±2"], "kps": ["kp_cube_root"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "任何数都有唯一的立方根，(-2)³=-8。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_064", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列各数中，是无理数的是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. 3.14", "B. √2", "C. 22/7", "D. √9"], "kps": ["kp_real_numbers"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "√2是无限不循环小数；√9=3是有理数。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_065", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "|-√5|=____。", "answer": "√5", "kps": ["kp_real_numbers"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "负数的绝对值是它的相反数，即√5。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_066", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "比较大小：√10____3.5（填>、<或=）。", "answer": "<", "kps": ["kp_real_numbers"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "(√10)²=10<3.5²=12.25，所以√10<3.5。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_067", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若∠α=35°，则∠α的补角为____°。", "answer": "145", "kps": ["kp_comp_supp"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "补角=180°-35°=145°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_068", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "∠1与∠2互余，∠1=52°，则∠2=____°。", "answer": "38", "kps": ["kp_comp_supp"], "difficulty": 0.25, "solution": "互余两角之和为90°，90°-52°=38°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_069", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "一个角为70°，则它的补角与余角的差为（　）", "answer": "C", "options": ["A. 45°", "B. 60°", "C. 90°", "D. 110°"], "kps": ["kp_comp_supp"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "补角110°、余角20°，差为90°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_070", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "直线AB、CD相交于点O，∠AOC=50°，则∠AOD=____°。", "answer": "130", "kps": ["kp_intersect_lines"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "∠AOD与∠AOC是邻补角，180°-50°=130°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_071", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "过直线外一点画已知直线的垂线，能画（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. 1条", "B. 2条", "C. 3条", "D. 无数条"], "kps": ["kp_intersect_lines"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "垂线的基本事实：过一点有且只有一条直线与已知直线垂直。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_072", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "∠1与∠2是对顶角，∠1=2x°，∠2=(x+30)°，则x=____。", "answer": "30", "kps": ["kp_intersect_lines"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "对顶角相等，2x=x+30，x=30。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_073", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "在同一平面内，不相交的两条直线叫做（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. 平行线", "B. 垂线", "C. 射线", "D. 线段"], "kps": ["kp_parallel_judge"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "平行线的定义，注意前提是同一平面内。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_074", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "直线AB、CD被第三条直线所截，∠1与∠2是同位角，∠1=75°。要使AB∥CD，则∠2=____°。", "answer": "75", "kps": ["kp_parallel_judge"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "同位角相等，两直线平行。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_075", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列条件中，不能判定两条直线平行的是（　）", "answer": "D", "options": ["A. 同位角相等", "B. 内错角相等", "C. 同旁内角互补", "D. 同旁内角相等"], "kps": ["kp_parallel_judge"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "同旁内角相等时未必互补，不能判定平行。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_076", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "AB∥CD，∠1与∠2是同位角，∠1=65°，则∠2=____°。", "answer": "65", "kps": ["kp_parallel_props"], "difficulty": 0.25, "solution": "两直线平行，同位角相等。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_077", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "直线a∥b，∠1与∠2是同旁内角，∠1=2∠2，则∠2=____°。", "answer": "60", "kps": ["kp_parallel_props"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "两直线平行，同旁内角互补，∠1+∠2=180°，3∠2=180°，∠2=60°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_078", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "若∠1与∠2是两平行线被第三条直线所截得到的内错角，则（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. ∠1=∠2", "B. ∠1+∠2=180°", "C. ∠1+∠2=90°", "D. ∠1与∠2大小不能确定"], "kps": ["kp_parallel_props"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "两直线平行，内错角相等。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_079", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "在平面直角坐标系中，点P(-2,3)所在的象限是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. 第一象限", "B. 第二象限", "C. 第三象限", "D. 第四象限"], "kps": ["kp_coordinates"], "difficulty": 0.25, "solution": "横坐标为负、纵坐标为正，是第二象限的点。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_080", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "点A(3,-4)到x轴的距离是____。", "answer": "4", "kps": ["kp_coordinates", "kp_absvalue"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "点到x轴的距离是纵坐标的绝对值，|-4|=4。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_081", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若点M(a,a-2)在x轴上，则a=____。", "answer": "2", "kps": ["kp_coordinates"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "x轴上的点纵坐标为0，a-2=0，a=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_082", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "教室里座位用（列，排）表示，小明的位置是(2,3)，小红在第4列第1排，她的位置表示为____。", "answer": "(4,1)", "kps": ["kp_coord_apply"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "按同样的有序数对规则写作(4,1)。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_083", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "将点P(2,-1)向左平移3个单位长度，得到的点的坐标是____。", "answer": "(-1,-1)", "kps": ["kp_coord_apply"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "向左平移，横坐标减3：2-3=-1，纵坐标不变。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_084", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "将点A(-3,2)向上平移4个单位长度，得到的点的坐标是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. (1,2)", "B. (-3,6)", "C. (-3,-2)", "D. (-7,2)"], "kps": ["kp_coord_apply"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "向上平移，纵坐标加4：2+4=6，横坐标不变。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_085", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列方程组中，是二元一次方程组的是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. x+y=3，x-y=1", "B. x+y=3，xy=2", "C. x+2y²=5，x-y=1", "D. x+y=3，1/x+y=2"], "kps": ["kp_sys_concept"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "方程组中每个方程都应是含两个未知数的一次整式方程；B含二次项xy，C含y²，D含分式1/x。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_086", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "二元一次方程x+y=5的正整数解共有____组。", "answer": "4", "kps": ["kp_sys_concept"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "x=1,2,3,4时y=4,3,2,1，共4组。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_087", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若x=2，y=-1是方程组 x+y=1，3x+ay=4 的解，则a=____。", "answer": "2", "kps": ["kp_sys_concept"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "代入第二个方程得6-a=4，a=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_088", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "方程组 x+y=7，x-y=3 的解是____。", "answer": "x=5，y=2", "kps": ["kp_sys_solve"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "两方程相加得2x=10，x=5，代入得y=2（加减消元）。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_089", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "用代入法解方程组 y=x+1，x+y=5，则x=____。", "answer": "2", "kps": ["kp_sys_solve"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "把y=x+1代入得x+x+1=5，2x=4，x=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_090", "item_type": "solve", "stem": "解方程组：x+2y=7，3x-y=7。", "answer": "x=3，y=2", "kps": ["kp_sys_solve"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "由第二个方程得y=3x-7，代入第一个方程：x+2(3x-7)=7，7x=21，x=3，y=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_091", "item_type": "solve", "stem": "鸡兔同笼：笼中有鸡兔共10只，脚共28只，鸡、兔各有多少只？（列二元一次方程组求解）", "answer": "鸡6只，兔4只", "kps": ["kp_sys_apply"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "设鸡x只、兔y只：x+y=10，2x+4y=28，解得x=6，y=4。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_092", "item_type": "solve", "stem": "买3支钢笔和2本笔记本共19元，买1支钢笔和3本笔记本共11元，钢笔和笔记本的单价各是多少？（列二元一次方程组求解）", "answer": "钢笔每支5元，笔记本每本2元", "kps": ["kp_sys_apply"], "difficulty": 0.65, "solution": "设钢笔每支x元、笔记本每本y元：3x+2y=19，x+3y=11，解得x=5，y=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_093", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "两个数的和为15，差为3，则较大的数是____。", "answer": "9", "kps": ["kp_sys_apply"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "设较大数为x、较小数为y：x+y=15，x-y=3，相加得2x=18，x=9。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_094", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若a<b，则-2a____-2b（填>、<或=）。", "answer": ">", "kps": ["kp_ineq_concept"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "不等式两边同乘负数，不等号方向改变。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_095", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列不等式变形正确的是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. 由a>b，得a+2>b+2", "B. 由a>b，得-3a>-3b", "C. 由a>b，得ac>bc", "D. 由a>b，得a-5<b-5"], "kps": ["kp_ineq_concept"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "不等式两边加同一个数，不等号方向不变；B乘负数应改变方向；C需c>0；D应得a-5>b-5。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_096", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "用不等式表示“x的3倍与2的差是负数”：____。", "answer": "3x-2<0", "kps": ["kp_ineq_concept"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "负数即小于0，列得3x-2<0。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_097", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "不等式2x-4>0的解集是____。", "answer": "x>2", "kps": ["kp_ineq_solve"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "移项得2x>4，两边除以2得x>2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_098", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "不等式-x+3≥0的解集是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. x≤3", "B. x≥3", "C. x≤-3", "D. x>3"], "kps": ["kp_ineq_solve"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "移项得-x≥-3，两边除以-1不等号方向改变，x≤3。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_099", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "不等式5x-1≤3(x+1)的解集是____。", "answer": "x≤2", "kps": ["kp_ineq_solve"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "去括号得5x-1≤3x+3，移项合并得2x≤4，x≤2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_100", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "不等式组 x>2，x<5 的解集是____。", "answer": "2<x<5", "kps": ["kp_ineq_group"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "不等式组的解集是各不等式解集的公共部分。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_101", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "不等式组 x>3，x>1 的解集是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. x>1", "B. x>3", "C. 1<x<3", "D. x<1"], "kps": ["kp_ineq_group"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "同大取大，解集为x>3。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_102", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "不等式组 x>-1，x≤2 的整数解共有____个。", "answer": "3", "kps": ["kp_ineq_group"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "解集为-1<x≤2，整数解为0、1、2，共3个。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_103", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "为了解一批灯泡的使用寿命，从中抽取100只进行检测。这次调查的样本容量是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. 这一批灯泡的使用寿命", "B. 100", "C. 抽取的100只灯泡的使用寿命", "D. 每只灯泡的使用寿命"], "kps": ["kp_data_collect"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "样本容量是样本中个体的数目，为100；C是样本，A是总体。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_104", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列调查中，适合用抽样调查的是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. 对全班同学身高的调查", "B. 对全国中学生睡眠时间的调查", "C. 对本校篮球队队员身高的调查", "D. 对机场旅客随身行李的安全检查"], "kps": ["kp_data_collect"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "调查范围大、耗时长的调查适合抽样调查；A、C范围小可用全面调查，D必须全面调查。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_105", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "对全体对象都一一进行调查的方式叫____调查。", "answer": "全面", "kps": ["kp_data_collect"], "difficulty": 0.25, "solution": "全面调查（普查）是对全体对象逐一调查。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_106", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "某班50名同学中步行上学的有25人，则在扇形统计图中表示步行部分的圆心角为____°。", "answer": "180", "kps": ["kp_data_charts"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "25÷50×360°=180°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_107", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "要反映某地一周内每天气温的变化情况，最合适的统计图是（　）", "answer": "B", "options": ["A. 条形统计图", "B. 折线统计图", "C. 扇形统计图", "D. 频数分布直方图"], "kps": ["kp_data_charts"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "折线统计图能反映数据的变化趋势。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_108", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在扇形统计图中，某部分占总体的30%，则对应扇形的圆心角为____°。", "answer": "108", "kps": ["kp_data_charts"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "360°×30%=108°。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_109", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "把50个数据分成5组，前四组的频数依次为6、9、12、10，则第五组的频数是____。", "answer": "13", "kps": ["kp_data_histogram"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "各组频数之和等于数据总数，50-(6+9+12+10)=13。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_110", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在频数分布直方图中，某小组的频数为8，数据总数为40，则该组的频率是____。", "answer": "0.2", "kps": ["kp_data_histogram"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "频率=频数÷数据总数=8÷40=0.2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_111", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "绘制频数分布直方图时，一组数据的最大值为172，最小值为149，取组距为3，则应分成的组数是（　）", "answer": "C", "options": ["A. 6", "B. 7", "C. 8", "D. 9"], "kps": ["kp_data_histogram"], "difficulty": 0.65, "solution": "(172-149)÷3≈7.7，应分成8组。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_112", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列说法中，正确的是（　）", "answer": "D", "options": ["A. 一个数不是正数就是负数", "B. 字母a表示的数一定是正数", "C. -a表示的数一定是负数", "D. 0既不是正数，也不是负数"], "kps": ["kp_posneg"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "0既不是正数也不是负数，A错；a可以表示任意有理数，B、C错（如a=-2时，-a=2是正数），D正确。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_113", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "数轴上与表示-1的点相距3个单位长度的点表示的数是____。", "answer": "-4或2", "kps": ["kp_numberline"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "分两侧考虑：在-1左边3个单位是-1-3=-4，在-1右边3个单位是-1+3=2，所以是-4或2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_114", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "若x与y互为相反数，则下列式子一定成立的是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. x+y=0", "B. x-y=0", "C. xy=1", "D. x/y=1"], "kps": ["kp_opposite"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "互为相反数的两数之和为0，A成立；x=y仅在x=y=0时成立，B不一定；xy=-x^2≤0，C不成立；y=0时x/y无意义，D不成立。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_115", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "已知|x|=5，|y|=3，且x<y，则x+y=____。", "answer": "-2或-8", "kps": ["kp_rational_add", "kp_absvalue"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "x=±5，y=±3；若x=5，则y>5与|y|=3矛盾，所以x=-5；y=3或y=-3，x+y=-2或-8。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_116", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算：4-(-2)×3=____。", "answer": "10", "kps": ["kp_mixed_ops"], "difficulty": 0.3, "misconceptions": ["mc_g7_ops_order"], "solution": "先算乘法：(-2)×3=-6，再算减法：4-(-6)=4+6=10。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_117", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "光在真空中的速度约为3×10^8米/秒，太阳光从太阳传到地球约需5×10^2秒，则太阳与地球之间的距离约为____米。（结果用科学记数法表示）", "answer": "1.5×10^11", "kps": ["kp_sci_notation", "kp_rational_mul"], "difficulty": 0.6, "misconceptions": ["mc_g7_sci_pow_offbyone"], "solution": "3×10^8×5×10^2=15×10^10=1.5×10^11（米）。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_118", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个两位数，十位上的数字为a，个位上的数字为b，用代数式表示这个两位数是____。", "answer": "10a+b", "kps": ["kp_algebraic"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "十位数字a表示a个十，即10a；个位数字b表示b个一，即b；合起来是10a+b。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_119", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若单项式3x^m·y^2的次数是5，则m=____。", "answer": "3", "kps": ["kp_monomial"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "单项式的次数是所有字母指数的和：m+2=5，所以m=3（系数3不计入次数）。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_120", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "若3x^a·y^3与-2x^2·y^b是同类项，则a+b=____。", "answer": "5", "kps": ["kp_like_terms"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "同类项要求相同字母的指数相同：a=2，b=3，所以a+b=5。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_121", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "用一张矩形纸片围成圆柱的侧面，已知圆柱的底面周长为10cm，高为8cm，则这张矩形纸片的面积是____cm²。", "answer": "80", "kps": ["kp_geometry_basic"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "圆柱侧面沿高展开是矩形，一条边等于底面周长10cm，另一条边等于高8cm，面积=10×8=80cm²。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_122", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "线段AB=10cm，点C在直线AB上，且BC=4cm，点M是AC的中点，则AM=____cm。", "answer": "3或7", "kps": ["kp_lines_rays"], "difficulty": 0.6, "solution": "分两种情况：①C在线段AB上，AC=10-4=6cm，AM=3cm；②C在线段AB的延长线上，AC=10+4=14cm，AM=7cm。所以AM为3或7cm。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_123", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "将点P先向右平移3个单位长度，再向下平移2个单位长度，得到点(1,-1)，则点P的坐标是____。", "answer": "(-2,1)", "kps": ["kp_coord_apply"], "difficulty": 0.55, "misconceptions": ["mc_g7_translate_dir"], "solution": "逆推：向右平移3个单位后横坐标为1，则P的横坐标为1-3=-2；向下平移2个单位后纵坐标为-1，则P的纵坐标为-1+2=1，所以P(-2,1)。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_124", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列各组x、y的值中，是方程组 x+y=3，x-y=1 的解的是（　）", "answer": "A", "options": ["A. x=2，y=1", "B. x=1，y=2", "C. x=3，y=0", "D. x=2，y=-1"], "kps": ["kp_sys_concept"], "difficulty": 0.25, "solution": "方程组的解须同时满足两个方程：A中2+1=3且2-1=1，都成立；B满足第一个但1-2=-1；C满足第一个但3-0=3；D中2+(-1)=1，不满足第一个方程。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_125", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "解方程组：y=2x，x+y=6，则x=____。", "answer": "2", "kps": ["kp_sys_solve"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "把y=2x代入x+y=6，得x+2x=6，3x=6，x=2。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_126", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "某班共有学生40人，其中男生人数比女生人数多4人，则男生有____人。", "answer": "22", "kps": ["kp_sys_apply"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "设男生x人、女生y人：x+y=40，x-y=4，两式相加得2x=44，x=22，男生22人。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_127", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "若a>b，则下列式子一定成立的是（　）", "answer": "C", "options": ["A. -2a>-2b", "B. ac²>bc²", "C. a-1>b-1", "D. 1/a<1/b"], "kps": ["kp_ineq_concept"], "difficulty": 0.6, "misconceptions": ["mc_g7_ineq_mul_neg"], "solution": "不等式两边减同一个数方向不变，C成立；A中同乘-2方向应改变，得-2a<-2b；B中c=0时ac²=bc²，不一定成立；D中取a=1，b=-1，1> -1，不成立。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_128", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "某校学生来自甲、乙、丙三个地区，在扇形统计图中，甲、乙两部分对应的圆心角分别为108°和144°，则丙地区学生人数占全校学生人数的百分比是____。", "answer": "30%", "kps": ["kp_data_charts"], "difficulty": 0.55, "solution": "丙对应的圆心角为360°-108°-144°=108°，所占百分比为108°÷360°×100%=30%。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "m7_129", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在频数分布表中，某小组的频数为10，频率为0.25，则数据总数为____。", "answer": "40", "kps": ["kp_data_histogram"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "频率=频数÷数据总数，所以数据总数=10÷0.25=40。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["m3-reviewer", "night-reverify-20260929"], "answers_agree": true}}
  ]
}
